We have identified strong buyer interest in your upcoming products. We'd like to discuss pre-order opportunities that could benefit both parties.

Please review and let us know your availability.

Best regards,
Admin Team`},"sample-request":{subject:"Sample Request from Potential Buyers",body:`Dear Producer,

We have buyers interested in sampling your products. Would you be able to provide samples for evaluation?

Best regards,
Admin Team`},"update-database":{subject:"Update Required: Product Information",body:`Dear Producer,

We've noticed some missing information in your product listings. Please update the following:
- Vintage information
- Pricing details
- Product attributes

This will help buyers make informed decisions.

Best regards,
Admin Team`},"renew-subscription":{subject:"Subscription Renewal Reminder",body:`Dear Producer,

Your subscription will expire soon. Renew now to continue enjoying premium features.

Best regards,
Admin Team`},reports:{subject:"Your Monthly Performance Report",body:`Dear Producer,

Please find attached your monthly performance report including views, offers, and sales metrics.

Best regards,
Admin Team`},"favorites-alert":{subject:"Your Products Have Been Favorited!",body:`Dear Producer,

Good news! Your products have been added to buyer favorites lists. This indicates strong interest.

